{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "qt.commitment",
  "$defs": {
    "Signature": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "An Ed25519 signature over `domain + \"\\n\" + canonical_json(body)` (RFC 8032, pure Ed25519).",
      "properties": {
        "algorithm": {
          "const": "ed25519",
          "default": "ed25519",
          "title": "Algorithm",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "public_key": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Public Key",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "key_fingerprint": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Key Fingerprint",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "value": {
          "title": "Value",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "public_key",
        "key_fingerprint",
        "value"
      ],
      "title": "Signature",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "`qt.commitment` (`queuetruth commit`): public, reveals nothing about the files but their number.\n\nLeaf i = sha256(`\"qt-commit-v1\\0leaf\\0\"` + nonce_i (32 bytes) + name_i (UTF-8) + `\"\\0\"` + sha256(file_i) (32\nbytes)); root = sha256(`\"qt-commit-v1\\0root\\0\"` + leaf_0 + ... + leaf_n-1). The nonces stay in the private\n`qt.commitment_opening` until reveal. `committed_at` is asserted by whoever ran `commit`; anchor `root`\nelsewhere (RFC 3161, a public post, a counterparty) to make it more than that.",
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "qt.commitment",
      "default": "qt.commitment",
      "title": "Schema",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "const": 1,
      "default": 1,
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "scheme": {
      "const": "qt-commit-v1",
      "default": "qt-commit-v1",
      "title": "Scheme",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "label": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Label"
    },
    "committed_at": {
      "title": "Committed At",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "n_items": {
      "title": "N Items",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "leaves": {
      "items": {
        "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Leaves",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "root": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Root",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "signature": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Signature"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "schema_version",
    "committed_at",
    "n_items",
    "leaves",
    "root"
  ],
  "type": "object"
}
